# Stable spec ID: iba-gin-fizz. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(gin) 45 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 30 ml
(simple syrup) 10 ml
(soda water) 1 splash

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(highball glass)

::instructions
<shake, gin and lemon juice and syrup with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into thin tall (highball glass) without serving ice>
(soda water) <add>
<garnish, with a lemon slice>
Optional [
  <garnish, with lemon zest>
]

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
The IBA explicitly serves this version without ice in the glass.

